      "text": "Lord, if now I have found favour in thy sight, Gen. 18:3. Rachel was beautiful and well favoured, Gen. 29:17. Joseph was a goodly person, and well favoured, Gen. 39:6. people favour in the sight of the Egyptians, Ex. 3:21. Samuel … was in favour both with the Lord, 1 Sam. 2:26. David … hath found favour in my sight, 1 Sam. 16:22 (Acts 7:45–46). Zion: for the time to favour her … is come, Ps. 102:13. good man sheweth favour, Ps. 112:5. So shalt thou find favour … in the sight of God, Prov. 3:4. good man obtaineth favour of the Lord, Prov. 12:2. Whoso findeth a wife … obtaineth favour of the Lord, Prov. 18:22. God had brought Daniel into favour, Dan. 1:9.",
